    "text": "千雪さん、は……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103006/4001030060420"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001030060430,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "千雪さんはプロデューサーさんの車で帰ったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103006/4001030060430"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001030060440,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そ、そっか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103006/4001030060440"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001030060450,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ……でも、ダメ……\r\n甜花の風邪……うつる、から……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103006/4001030060450"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001030060460,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "その風邪、誰の風邪でしょーか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103006/4001030060460"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001030060470,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……？　あ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103006/4001030060470"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001030060471,
    "speaker": "甘奈＆甜花",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103006/4001030060471"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001030060472,
    "speaker": "甘奈＆甜花",
    "text": "えへへ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103006/4001030060472"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0328",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 4001030060480,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……小っちゃい頃もさ、\r\nこんなことしたよね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103006/4001030060480"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001030060490,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "パパとママには風邪を引いた甜花ちゃんには\r\n近づいちゃダメーって言われたけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103006/4001030060490"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001030060500,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "なーちゃん……\r\nいつも、甜花のお布団に来てくれた……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103006/4001030060500"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001030060510,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈が風邪の時には、\r\n甜花ちゃんも来てくれたよ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103006/4001030060510"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001030060520,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それで、結局ふたりで風邪引いて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103006/4001030060520"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001030060530,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\nそうだった……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103006/4001030060530"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001030060540,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "なんかさ……一緒に風邪引くの、\r\n久しぶりだね……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103006/4001030060540"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
